00:29:47.250 --> 00:29:50.250
But this is also a change that you can make at runtime.

484
00:29:50.250 --> 00:29:56.890
So if I were to, I can just get my smart link component

485
00:29:56.890 --> 00:30:02.880
and just do set link enabled.

486
00:30:02.880 --> 00:30:04.880
I can never remember the function name.

487
00:30:04.880 --> 00:30:15.319
Enabled.

488
00:30:15.319 --> 00:30:24.109
Hmm, might be valid.

489
00:30:24.109 --> 00:30:29.109
It's, yeah, sorry, I lose the terms.

