00:30:31.109 --> 00:30:42.079
Okay, sorry, it's built into the nav proxy itself,

492
00:30:42.079 --> 00:30:44.079
not the component, my apologies.

493
00:30:44.079 --> 00:30:46.079
But either way, set smart link enabled,

494
00:30:46.079 --> 00:30:48.079
this is the function on the nav link proxy itself,

495
00:30:48.079 --> 00:30:50.079
and you can use that at runtime

496
00:30:50.079 --> 00:30:52.079
to toggle whether or not that's enabled.

497
00:30:52.079 --> 00:30:54.079
So that's kind of one component of it.

498
00:30:54.079 --> 00:30:57.079
But the other kind of useful thing to be aware of

499
00:30:57.079 --> 00:30:59.079
is once you're using smart links,

