00:31:51.079 --> 00:31:54.079
We would kind of lock that door off so other actors couldn't use it,

514
00:31:54.079 --> 00:31:57.079
so we couldn't have two actors passing through this door at once.

515
00:31:57.079 --> 00:32:00.079
And then we would kind of enter a pre-canned door opening animation

516
00:32:00.079 --> 00:32:03.079
to make the hand nicely marry up to the door handle

517
00:32:03.079 --> 00:32:05.079
and kind of navigate through that.

518
00:32:05.079 --> 00:32:09.079
That's an example of all the different capabilities and power

519
00:32:09.079 --> 00:32:11.079
that these smart links provide us.
